@startuml
autonumber
actor Admin
boundary DashboardView
control DashboardController
entity SparepartModel
database Database

title Sequence Diagram - Lihat Dashboard & Notifikasi Stok Menipis

Admin -> DashboardView : Akses Halaman /dashboard
DashboardView -> DashboardController : GET /dashboard
activate DashboardController

DashboardController -> Database : Query data ringkasan statistik (Total Kategori, Transaksi Hari Ini)
activate Database
Database --> DashboardController : Data ringkasan
deactivate Database

DashboardController -> SparepartModel : where('stok', '<=', 'stok_minimal')->get()
activate SparepartModel
SparepartModel -> Database : SELECT * FROM spareparts WHERE stok <= stok_minimal
activate Database
Database --> SparepartModel : Record sparepart kritis
deactivate Database
SparepartModel --> DashboardController : Data sparepart kritis
deactivate SparepartModel

DashboardController -> DashboardController : Hitung total item kritis untuk Badge Menu

DashboardController --> DashboardView : Render /dashboard dengan data statistik & daftar kritis
deactivate DashboardController

DashboardView --> Admin : Tampilkan grafik, badge notifikasi merah di sidebar, & widget stok kritis
@endum
